SERVER-SIDE FORECAST DATA AND REMOVED SERVICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

6. Open-Meteo forecast API — 850 hPa wind on a coarse BC grid, fetched server-side
   at most once per hour and served to visitors as data/live/wind.json.
   Licence: CC BY 4.0 on the data; API-use terms apply separately to the operator.
   Attribution: Weather data by Open-Meteo.com.
   Missing or stale wind uses still air, labelled on the monitor.

7. Esri World Imagery — removed 2026-10-01. No tiles are loaded or redistributed.
   The default backdrop is the first-party terrain hillshade listed in item 4.

